  The only thing you need to pass to build_pipeline_plan() to enable multi-node awareness is num_hosts and num_devices_per_host (instead of just world_size), so get_submesh_choices can generate multi-host submesh candidates. The rest of the cross-node    
  handling is inherited from NCCL and the existing DeviceMesh / ProcessGroupMesh infrastructure.